Package: DialogaR
Title: ETL, Aggregation and Reporting for Diálogo Social
Version: 0.3.2
Authors@R: 
    person("Rafael", "Lopez", , "rlopez@morant.com.mx", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Data processing and reporting engine for Diálogo Social field
    survey operations. Provides ETL pipelines for multi-zone SQL databases,
    hierarchical aggregation (general, distrito, brigada, vocero), and
    automated report generation in Excel, PowerPoint, and PDF formats.
    Includes quality auditing tools and Google Drive publishing utilities.
